          {
            "at": "2026-10-02T10:45:51.236947+00:00",
            "by": {
              "type": "pipeline",
              "stage": "deterministic_svg"
            },
            "value": {
              "html": "<p>По­ло­жив <span data-inline-latex=\"t=3^{x}\\gt 0\"></span>, по­лу­ча­ем не­ра­вен­ство <span data-inline-latex=\"t^{2}+3t+\\frac{3}{t}+\\frac{1}{t^{2}}\\le 8\"></span>  или  <span data-inline-latex=\"(t^{^{2}}+\\frac{1}{t^{2}})+3(t+\\frac{1}{t})\\le 8\"></span>.  Пусть те­перь <span data-inline-latex=\"y=t+\\frac{1}{t}\\gt 0\"></span>,  тогда <span data-inline-latex=\"t^{^{2}}+\\frac{1}{t^{2}}=(t+\\frac{1}{t})^{2}-2=y^{2}-2\"></span>  и дан­ное не­ра­вен­ство при­ни­ма­ет вид <span data-inline-latex=\"y^{2}+3y-10\\le 0\"></span>. Решая по­след­нее не­ра­вен­ство, на­хо­дим  <span data-inline-latex=\"-5\\le y\\le 2\"></span>. Учи­ты­вая усло­вие <span data-inline-latex=\"y\\gt 0\"></span>, по­лу­ча­ем <span data-inline-latex=\"0\\lt t+\\frac{1}{t}\\le 2\"></span>,  от­ку­да <span data-inline-latex=\"t=1\"></span>, <span data-inline-latex=\"3^{x}=1\"></span>, <span data-inline-latex=\"x=0\"></span>.</p>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
